      { "@type": "Question", "name": "How quickly can you reach me in St Helens?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "We guarantee a 30 minute response across St Helens and surrounding areas. WA10 town centre is typically reached in under 25 minutes. Newton-le-Willows, Haydock, Rainford and Billinge are around 30 to 35 minutes. We know the roads across St Helens borough and are on our way as soon as you call." } },
