          <h2>Finding a Trustworthy Plumber in St Helens</h2>
          <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem;margin:0.75rem 0 0.4rem;text-align:center;">How do I know if an emergency plumber in St Helens is legit?</h3>
          <p>Always check Gas Safe registration before any plumber works on a gas appliance or boiler. This is not optional and it is illegal to work on gas without it. Verify any firm's registration at <a href="https://www.gassaferegister.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">gassaferegister.co.uk</a>. Ask clearly whether the engineer who arrives will be their own staff or a sub-contractor. Ask for a written quote before any work begins. A legit firm will agree to all three without hesitation.</p>
